      "actions": 2,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Grace Strides twice; if she ends her movement within melee reach of at least one enemy, she can make a melee Strike against that enemy. Grace can Fly instead of Stride if she has a fly speed (such as with Angelic Wings)."
